<h1>SALARY CERTIFICATE</h1>
<p>I, the undersigned, {{company.name}}, whose head office is located at {{company.address}},</p>
<p>hereby certify that:</p>
<p><strong>{{employee.fullName}}</strong>, holder of national ID <strong>{{employee.cin}}</strong>, is employed within our company since <strong>{{formatDate employee.hireDate}}</strong>.</p>
<p>They currently occupy the position of <strong>{{employee.function}}</strong> within the <strong>{{employee.department}}</strong> department, under <strong>{{employee.contractType}}</strong> contract.</p>
<p>In this capacity, they receive a monthly gross salary of <strong>{{formatCurrency employee.salary}}</strong>.</p>
<p>This certificate is issued to the interested party for legal purposes.</p>

<table class="sig-table">
  <tr>
    <td>
      <div class="sig-box">
        <span class="sig-label">Issued in Casablanca, on {{meta.generatedAt}}</span>
      </div>
    </td>
    <td class="sig-spacer"></td>
    <td>
      <div class="sig-box">
        <span class="sig-label">Signature and stamp</span>
        <span class="sig-sublabel">Company Representative</span>
      </div>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
